# No Kiriage Mangan on non-dealer tsumo in both rulesets: 4 han 30 fu = 2000 / 3900 (NOT 2000 / 4000)
# (rules.md §1 kiriage_mangan_enabled, §3.2, §4 item 20).
# Seat 0 discards 2m -> Seat 1 calls chi:34m and discards 9m.
# Seats 2, 3, 0 tsumogiri; Seat 1 draws 7s and wins by tsumo!
# Scoring for Seat 1 (non-dealer, South):
#   Hand: 678m 234p 06s 88p + chi 234m + tsumo 7s (dora ind 7p -> dora 8p x2; red 0s -> aka:1)
#   Yaku: tanyao (1) + dora:2 (88p) + aka:1 (0s) = 4 han
#   Fu: 20 base + 2 tsumo = 22 -> 30 fu
#   Non-dealer 4 han 30 fu tsumo: 2000 / 3900 (+7900, NOT 2000 / 4000)!

